      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here is a draft of the High-Rise Fire/Evacuation protocol summary:\n\nDuring a high-rise fire, all occupants are to evacuate the building using stairwells to the designated assembly point. Beزل climbers (if feasible) can use to access upper floors. Evacuees are to follow all instructions from 911 dispatch and on-site personnel. Critical decisions should be made by designated incident commanders and secondary commanders following instructions from primary incident commanders.",
