      "content": "The draft cut off at the end there, can you finish the Communication section?\n\nAlso, the dispatch guys are still complaining. The urgency score is still practically zero. They need the summary to trigger an alert on the dash so the units actually pay attention to it when the drill starts. \n\nI really don't want you to just list \"urgent, urgent, urgent,\" but can you try to weave in those key terms (urgent, immediate, critical, emergency, danger, warning) naturally into the procedures? Like, \"An immediate response is required\" or \"Critical monitoring of the stairs.\" Just make sure it still reads like a professional manual and doesn't lose the actual instructions. Once you finish the communication part, just give me the full updated version.",
